# Bring the chamber back to air within a safe window
# Closes the gate and vacuum valves, waits for the platen and shroud to be
# between 10 and 60 °C, opens the vent valve and waits for 700 Torr. Each
# temperature wait is bounded by the minutes given; after a cold soak it can be
# long. It leaves the vacuum pump running, since it may be backing the turbo
# pump. The vent valve is left open, as the chamber's own screen leaves it.
block vent within <minutes:number 1..600 min>
load rLACO

hvc gate close
hvc rough close
until platenT > 10 C within {minutes} min
until platenT < 60 C within {minutes} min
until shroudT > 10 C within {minutes} min
until shroudT < 60 C within {minutes} min
hvc vent open
until chamberP > 700 within 10 min
